  "translation": "Today my friend and I went to the supermarket together. We both wanted to buy some fruit and vegetables. We first went to look at apples and bananas; apples were very expensive but bananas were very cheap, so we didn't buy apples, only bought bananas. Then we went to buy milk; the milk was in the fridge. We took two cups of milk, and also bought bread there. Finally we went to checkout; at the exit we saw our classmate Xiao Li. We paid. He asked what we bought; we told him we bought fruit, milk and bread. We said goodbye to him, then went home from the supermarket. Today we were very happy."
